{
  "_comment": [
    "Desensitised SenseCAP (SenseCAP Cloud / device_sensor_data) uplink sequence for a T1000.",
    "Device EUI, application id and beacon MACs are replaced with synthetic values;",
    "the field layout follows the SenseCAP uplink protocol used by",
    "server/handler/message_format_hanlder.py:parse_sensecap_payload():",
    "  topic = /device_sensor_data/{applicationID}/{devEUI}/{channel}/{type}/{measurementId}",
    "  payload = {\"value\": <measurement value>, \"timestamp\": <unix ms>}",
    "measurementId mapping: 4197=longitude, 4198=latitude, 4200=SOS, 5002=BLE scan, 3000=battery.",
    "3000 is the packet terminator: the parser only emits a TrackerReport on 3000."
